---
/**
 * Asynchronous plugin work: outbox fan-out, event delivery retries and
 * scheduled jobs.
 */
---

<figure class="fc-diagram">
  <svg
    class="fc-seq"
    viewBox="0 0 920 720"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="fc-plugin-async-title fc-plugin-async-desc"
  >
    <title id="fc-plugin-async-title">Plugin events and jobs sequence</title>
    <desc id="fc-plugin-async-desc">
      A commerce transaction appends an outbox event. After the response, the
      dispatcher claims due rows, fans them out to subscribed plugins, and posts
      the event to the plugin host. Failures retry with exponential backoff and
      move to the dead letter after five attempts. Scheduled jobs follow the
      same host path through the jobs handler.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="fc-plugin-async-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="9"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto-start-reverse"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="fc-arrow"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="7" y="24" width="116" height="36" rx="7"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="65" y="46" text-anchor="middle">Commerce tx</text>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="167" y="24" width="116" height="36" rx="7"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="225" y="46" text-anchor="middle">Outbox + jobs</text>

    <rect class="fc-box-accent" x="332" y="24" width="116" height="36" rx="7"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="390" y="46" text-anchor="middle">Dispatcher</text>

    <rect class="fc-box" x="497" y="24" width="116" height="36" rx="7"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="555" y="46" text-anchor="middle">Plugin host</text>

    <rect class="fc-box-brand" x="647" y="24" width="116" height="36" rx="7"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="705" y="46" text-anchor="middle">Plugin worker</text>

    <rect class="fc-box-info" x="792" y="24" width="116" height="36" rx="7"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="850" y="46" text-anchor="middle">Host API</text>

    <path class="fc-lifeline" d="M 65 60 V 650"></path>
    <path class="fc-lifeline" d="M 225 60 V 650"></path>
    <path class="fc-lifeline" d="M 390 60 V 650"></path>
    <path class="fc-lifeline" d="M 555 60 V 650"></path>
    <path class="fc-lifeline" d="M 705 60 V 650"></path>
    <path class="fc-lifeline" d="M 850 60 V 650"></path>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 65 100 H 223" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="71" y="94">append event (same tx)</text>

    <path class="fc-line-dashed" d="M 20 135 H 900"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="460" y="152" text-anchor="middle">HTTP response already sent · at-least-once delivery</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 390 185 H 227" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="384" y="179" text-anchor="end">claim due (2 s tick)</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 390 215 h 30 v 12 h -30" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="426" y="209">fan out per subscription</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 390 245 H 553" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="396" y="239">POST /events (actor=event)</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 555 275 H 703" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="561" y="269">events handler</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 705 305 H 848" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="711" y="299">live data (optional)</text>

    <path class="fc-line-dashed" d="M 850 335 H 707" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="844" y="329" text-anchor="end">JSON</text>

    <path class="fc-line-dashed" d="M 705 365 H 557" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="699" y="359" text-anchor="end">2xx / 5xx</text>

    <path class="fc-line-dashed" d="M 555 395 H 392" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="549" y="389" text-anchor="end">status</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 390 425 H 227" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="384" y="419" text-anchor="end">done · backoff · dead</text>

    <path class="fc-line-dashed" d="M 20 455 H 900"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="460" y="472" text-anchor="middle">scheduled cron or manually enqueued job</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 390 505 H 227" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="384" y="499" text-anchor="end">cron due → job row</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 390 535 H 553" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="396" y="529">POST /jobs/name</text>

    <path class="fc-line" d="M 555 565 H 703" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="561" y="559">jobs handler</text>

    <path class="fc-line-dashed" d="M 705 595 H 557" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="699" y="589" text-anchor="end">result</text>

    <path class="fc-line-dashed" d="M 555 625 H 392" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-async-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="549" y="619" text-anchor="end">completed / failed</text>

    <rect class="fc-tag" x="40" y="665" width="840" height="38" rx="7"></rect>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="54" y="689">
      Retries use exponential backoff (5 × 2^n seconds). Events dead-letter after five attempts; jobs keep their own attempt count.
    </text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>Figure 6.</strong> Plugin work is never on the merchant's request
    path. Outbox events and job rows are durable and claimed with leases, so a
    restart resumes delivery instead of losing it.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
